   "subject": "Questions regarding TMT analysis",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\">Dear MSstats team,</span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\">I have a few questions regarding TMT analysis using your package MSstatsTMT.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\">1. Why normalisation is to be applied after summarisation?</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\">2. What is the difference between summarisation method “msstats” and “ MedianPolish”? In method msstats the summary method is still TMP!</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\">3. The vignette of the package is not explaining the statistical concepts behind TMT analysis. Would you please address me to some resources on this regard? </div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\">4. In PDtoMSstatsTMTFormat, the the parameter “summaryforMultipleRows” is set to sum by default. Shouldn’t it be applied after normalisation?</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\">5. Normalization between MS runs will be done by using Norm channels. But don&#39;t we also need to normalise between channels after combining the fractions (or before that)?</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\">I’m sorry if it is already too many questions.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\">Best regards and many thanks in advance for your help.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Roboto,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\">Farhad</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "GH8XZf5RDgAJ",
